 ard production costs\, plus two Kodak awards of five 400ft rolls of 16mm f
 ilm stock with complete processing\, and one USD 10\,000 post-production p
 ackage from Periscope.\n\nOrganisation: First Flights Media Limited\, with
  Kodak and Periscope\nLocation: UK-based fund\, open to filmmakers worldwi
 de\nAward: Up to GBP 7\,000 / USD 10\,000 cash toward production\; plus tw
 o Kodak awards of 5 x 400ft rolls of 16mm stock with full processing\, and
