 e New Media Caucus is an international nonprofit. Open to BIPOC undergradu
 ate and graduate students in new media art fields.\nAward: Multiple unrest
 ricted awards of varying amounts up to USD 500 each\, funded through donor
  contributions. Awardees are also featured in an NMC Header/Footer Gallery
  exhibition and a digitally published interview. Free to apply.\n\nMore: h
